  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "If open chatbox in some VRCStation, \"Gounded\" turn to false and VelocityY start to increase.\n\nI confirmed this issue occur in movable VRCStation (in https://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_e055f1a3-6fcb-4d19-9945-f0a1c92cc19b), VRCStation in Avatar, and hight changable VRCStation.\n\nVRCStation in \"VRChat Home\" does not occur this issue.\n\nThis issue does not directly affect to avatar pose (normaly , avatar pose is controled by Sitting layer or VRCStation's Animator), but it has occur unintentionally tracking control setting by some layer, and unintentionally tracking causes strange pose.",
